From 4bff4797bdab7f8ef25965554c69bea57feb2235 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: p0werj0int <330091335+overp0werj0int@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 00:03:36 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Qualify Omarchy theme colors for QtQuick 6.12

QtQuick now exports a Color singleton that shadows the unqualified Omarchy palette. Use a namespaced Commons import throughout the popup and settings components, and cover the runtime palette bindings in the existing QML load check.
---
